# Language and outputs

- Chat with the user/mentor: Chinese, English, or mixed — fine.
- **All repo artifacts must be English:** README, milestone docs, architecture, LEARNING_LOG, code, comments, commit messages, file/directory names, CLI help text.
- Do not add Chinese prose into committed docs or source files.
- Prefer precise agent/LLM vocabulary (checkpointer, interrupt, tool_calls, progressive disclosure) over vague marketing language.
